        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree fd9badc5db222a9c8276368d99f56318b5a93d55\nparent dd96035e031edf56fcf66a09d443f257a346af1f\nauthor Erick Cestari <erickcestari03@gmail.com> 1795789974 -0300\ncommitter Erick Cestari <erickcestari03@gmail.com> 1795789974 -0300\n\nfuzz: fix timelock range in miniscript_smart\n\nConsumeNodeSmart drew older()/after() values from [1, 0x7FFFFFF], one F\nshort of the [1, 0x7FFFFFFF] range the stable target uses. after() thus\nnever reached LOCKTIME_THRESHOLD, so the smart target never built\ntime-based after() nodes and never exercised the height/time timelock\nmixing rules in ComputeType.\n",
